# Environment files have no Prettier parser and may hold secrets — never format them.
.env
.env.*

# The blueprint is the source of truth and it is authored by humans, not by a formatter.
# Prettier reflows markdown tables, which produces a large, meaningless diff on documents whose
# whole value is that they are stable and citable. `docs/adr/` is additionally generated, and
# reformatting it would break the drift gate against the register.
docs/

# The golden dataset is deliberately malformed source; formatting it would repair the defects
# the benchmarks exist to measure. Results are generated.
tooling/benchmarks/golden
tooling/benchmarks/results

# The certification samples are the same: deliberately-broken fixtures (invalid JSON, malformed
# HTML/CSS) the runner analyzes and repairs. Formatting them would undo what they exist to test.
# Results are generated.
samples/certification
tooling/certification/results

# The validation corpus is real-shaped source carrying naturally-occurring defects the harness
# analyzes and repairs; formatting it would repair the defects under test. Results are generated.
tooling/validation/projects
tooling/validation/results
